/-!
# Binary data for the PSL₃(3) cycle quotient

Rows are packed with column j in bit j. The 52-by-27 inclusion has the
constant cycle as column zero. Its last 26 columns give the quotient model.
These tables are generated from the native point and line action in
`PrincipalModels.Coordinates`; they carry no mathematical assumptions.
The adjoining certificate and geometry modules prove their identities.
Source context: Guralnick--Malle, Classification of 2F-modules I, Proposition 4.2.
-/

